  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now after this it came to pass, that David smote the Philistines, and subdued them, and took Gath and her towns out of the hand of the Philistines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he smote Moab; and the Moabites became David's servants,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brought gifts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And David smote Hadarezer king of Zobah unto Hamath, as he went to stablish his dominion by the river Euphrates.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David took from him a thousand chariots, and seven thousand horsemen, and twenty thousand footmen: David also houghed all the chariot",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "horses",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but reserved of them an hundred chariots.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the Syrians of Damascus came to help Hadarezer king of Zobah, David slew of the Syrians two and twenty thousand men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David put",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "garrisons",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in Syria-damascus; and the Syrians became David's servants,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brought gifts. Thus the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "preserved David whithersoever he went.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David took the shields of gold that were on the servants of Hadarezer, and brought them to Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likewise from Tibhath, and from Chun, cities of Hadarezer, brought David very much brass, wherewith Solomon made the brasen sea, and the pillars, and the vessels of brass.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Now when Tou king of Hamath heard how David had smitten all the host of Hadarezer king of Zobah;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sent Hadoram his son to king David, to enquire of his welfare, and to congratulate him, because he had fought against Hadarezer, and smitten him; (for Hadarezer had war with Tou;) and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all manner of vessels of gold and silver and brass.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Them also king David dedicated unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", with the silver and the gold that he brought from all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "these",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nations; from Edom, and from Moab, and from the children of Ammon, and from the Philistines, and from Amalek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover Abishai the son of Zeruiah slew of the Edomites in the valley of salt eighteen thousand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And he put garrisons in Edom; and all the Edomites became David's servants. Thus the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "preserved David whithersoever he went.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ So David reigned over all Israel, and executed judgment and justice among all his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joab the son of Zeruiah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over the host; and Jehoshaphat the son of Ahilud, recorder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Zadok the son of Ahitub, and Abimelech the son of Abiathar,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the priests; and Shavsha was scribe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Benaiah the son of Jehoiada",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over the Cherethites and the Pelethites; and the sons of David",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.18.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chief about the king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
